of species and backgrounds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078150/extras/d02c452be510d440d991885f6e3b7204.webp?t=1743541052\" width=620 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3078150/extras/6d627007e61e7a669bf749043c3fcc03.avif?t=1743541052\" width=128 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About Us</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NEARstudios is a group of game developers from AAA studios such as Bethesda, BioWare, and Naughty Dog who are taking the indie path, developing their first passion project with the help of their players and community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sign up for updates and be invited to future playtests on the official Hawthorn website (linked in the right-side column of this page, above social media).</p>",
